==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[enquire]] (''chiefly UK/Commonwealth'')

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈkwaɪɹ/}} {{SAMPA|/In"kwaIr/}} {{a|UK}}
* {{audio|en-us-inquire.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|inquires|inquiring|inquired}} (''intransitive'' or ''transitive'')

# {{US}} To [[ask]] (about something).
# To make an [[inquiry]] or an [[investigation]].

====Usage notes====
* In UK/Commonwealth English, the spelling '''[[enquire]]''' is more common, with '''inquire''' often reserved for official [[inquest]]s.  In the US, both spellings are acceptable, though '''inquire''' is favored most often.

====Derived terms====
* [[inquire after]]
* [[inquire of]]

[[Category:English reporting verbs]]

